# Fred VIP list — one email address per line.
# Emails matching these addresses will be highlighted with a 🌟 in the mailbox pane.
# Lines beginning with # are comments and are ignored.
# Blank lines are also ignored.
#
# Copy this file to ~/.claude/state/fred/vips.txt and add your own addresses.
# The vips.txt file is gitignored (user-local); this example is tracked.
#
# Examples:
#   boss@example.com
#   important.client@corp.com
#   cto@mycompany.com
